  "ingredients": [
    "6 slices bacon, chopped",
    "1 onion, chopped",
    "3 eggs",
    "0.75 cup buttermilk baking mix",
    "1.5 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley",
    "2 cups shredded American cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease two 24-cup mini muffin pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AAe-D4wKGkm7VxDPRmUz32YtcdI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/40023-easy-mini-quiches-DDMFS-Step-01-4486-2616f987395f4cf6a4af28f1f8c252dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40023/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook bacon and onion together in a large skillet over medium heat until bacon is crisp and onion is tender, about 5 minutes. Drain on paper towels and set aside to cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ppy74_Ff7kbED66i1GceduZdbWI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/40023-easy-mini-quiches-DDMFS-Step-02-4487-dd4ba209cfc4464da39df085a90b538c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40023/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs in a medium bowl. Stir in baking mix, parsley, cheese, bacon, and onion until evenly combined. Spoon the mixture into the prepared muffin cups, filling each about 3/4 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qp7h4_9IABhtH5gZmquSe3QjQKA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/40023-easy-mini-quiches-DDMFS-Step-03-4488-3e273833d2c2442a9aab5d185161b269.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40023/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the tops are lightly browned, about 10 to 15 minutes. Allow mini quiches to cool in the pan before carefully removing with a small knife or spatula.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mVDdhBK5WQ6KoBS2Pww-CN6tKTM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/40023-easy-mini-quiches-DDMFS-Step-04-4493-56e1daede6d64373899d265d7ef582b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40023/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
